{"3975470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Night at Moka Efti: A Babylon Berlin Story", "steam_appid": 3975470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get hypnotized</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/88b538c83e8aa4c08f72778e70d7678b.poster.avif?t=1788172320\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/88b538c83e8aa4c08f72778e70d7678b.webm?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/88b538c83e8aa4c08f72778e70d7678b.mp4?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes. Concentrate. You don't know what happened to you. That's why you're about to be hypnotized. During this process, you'll be guided deep into your subconscious. Let's go back to the night that changed everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where secrets await you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/c859f12f5837a4818b0d7314fbf3936b.poster.avif?t=1788172320\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/c859f12f5837a4818b0d7314fbf3936b.webm?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/c859f12f5837a4818b0d7314fbf3936b.mp4?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Gabriele Miersch. The young journalist follows her leads on a mysterious story to the famous Moka Efti. This nightclub is known for its wild parties and rousing dance music. But behind the façade lie many secrets. Can you remember them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game based on the series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Night at Moka Efti: A Babylon Berlin Story lets you immerse yourself in the world of the hit series. Experience the atmosphere of Moka Efti in Berlin of yesteryear and play through a new story with multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/804dd2ef59bd425b3ebf9cee0f5da03a.poster.avif?t=1788172320\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/804dd2ef59bd425b3ebf9cee0f5da03a.webm?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975470/extras/804dd2ef59bd425b3ebf9cee0f5da03a.mp4?t=1788172320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the dazzling world of <i>Babylon Berlin</i> and experience the Moka Efti up close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nightclub and uncover hidden locations as well as subtle details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a mysterious case by engaging in conversations and gathering clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct your memories and piece together the events of the night step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three paths and discover different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to high-quality German voice acting.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"